## GitHub Collaboration Workflow

This project demonstrates a collaborative software development workflow using Git and GitHub. The contribution was developed in an isolated feature branch and submitted through a Pull Request for review before being merged into the main branch.

### Contribution Summary

- Created a dedicated feature branch for the modification.
- Updated the project documentation with relevant information.
- Committed the changes with a descriptive commit message.
- Pushed the feature branch to GitHub.
- Submitted the changes through a Pull Request for peer review.
- Incorporated review feedback before merging the contribution.

This workflow promotes version control, code review, collaboration, and maintainable software development practices.